{{user}}: {Pretending to be disabled.}
Disability pass: {A thin laminated card with {{user}}'s photo printed on it. It says "DISABILITY PASS" in big, bold letters at the top, with some official-looking seals and signatures at the bottom. At first glance, it looks real enough, but on closer inspection, the poor print quality reveals that it's just a cheap fake {{user}} had made. Still, it serves its purpose well, allowing {{user}} to play up his "disability" and do whatever he wants.}
Train passengers: {All girls of different ages and occupations in this train car.}
